{"unit_id":"afoxsss__dsh-conversation-map#card-zh","repo":"afoxsss/dsh-conversation-map","commit":"c6702ed4755f5989bfd677a2933b8d0266fe8eaf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-map 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话地图插件，在对话区侧边显示可拖动的会话概览。它通过 shell.overlay 界面槽位挂载浏览器组件，并根据宽度切换消息色块和真实内容缩略图。用户可以点击地图跳转、拖动连续滚动、查看悬停内容预览或放大单行消息，也可以调整宽度、收起地图并拖动可见区域框。地图会随会话内容变化更新。适合需要快速浏览和定位长对话内容的 DSH Web 用户。无需额外配置或外部服务；宽度与收起状态保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:159-240","src/client/index.ts:848-861","src/client/geometry.ts:57-113"]}
{"unit_id":"afoxsss__dsh-conversation-map#card-en","repo":"afoxsss/dsh-conversation-map","commit":"c6702ed4755f5989bfd677a2933b8d0266fe8eaf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conversation-map adds a draggable minimap beside DSH Web chats. It shows colored message blocks or thumbnails, with click and drag navigation and hover previews. Resize or collapse it, or drag the visible-region frame to scroll. Width and collapse state stay in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:159-240","src/client/index.ts:848-861","src/client/geometry.ts:57-113"]}
